  <Translations>
    <Translation Language="en-US">The practice opens it on your first visit. Once you have it, you'll see your conditions, allergies and vaccines here, and you'll be able to check in.</Translation>
    <Translation Language="es-CO">La abre el consultorio en tu primera visita. Cuando la tengas, aquí verás tus condiciones, alergias y vacunas, y podrás hacer tu pre-registro.</Translation>
  </Translations>
</Dictionary>